<title>DUBAI: TENNIS-DUBAI OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DUBAI OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinals results in the $1</p>
<p>million Dubai Open men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Jiri Novak (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-1 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>2-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat Jim Courier (U.S.) 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>2-6, 6-3</p>
</text>
